  "title": "Spot to Web3 Migration: What Mudrex Users Need to Know",
  "summary": "At Mudrex, we regularly review the tokens available on our platform to ensure that users continue to have access to assets with reasonable liquidity, availability and trading support. As part of this review process, certain tokens may be moved from Spot to Web3 when centralised liquidity for those assets becomes limited. This migration helps users […]",
